            "text": "Will you buy anything besides bones?",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "Will you buy anything besides bones?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "Well, I've had a few people bring me some interesting giant shells. They say they came from giant snails and giant tortoises."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Of course, like the bones, some shells are better than others. I'll give you 250gp for ordinary shells, but what I really need are perfect shells. I'll pay double for them and give you a few tips about Crafting too."
