          {
            "text": "What kind of bones do you need?",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "What kind of bones do you need?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "Enormous bones, as big as you can get. Not just any big bones will do."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Sometimes you might find a particularly long, straight bone. That's the kind of thing I need; I'll give you 1,000gp for one of them."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Occasionally, you might find a long curved bone - these are especially valuable - I'll give you 2,000gp for them."
              },
              {
                "npc": "I'll also teach you a bit about how we use the bones in Construction, if you like."
              },
              {
                "type": "choice",
                "options": [
